    13	
    14	Each formalisation lives in its own subdirectory:
    15	
    16	```
    17	experiments/formalisations/<edge_id_or_result>/
    18	    <name>.lean            # the Lean 4 source — must type-check
    19	    <name>_notes.md        # informal proof sketch + which edge/result
    20	                           # this formalises + status (statement-only,
    21	                           # skeleton-with-sorries, complete, etc.)
    22	    lakefile.lean          # if needed for the subdirectory
    23	    lean-toolchain         # if pinned
    24	```
    25	
    26	## Why Lean
    27	
    28	- **Forces precision.** Vague claims fail to type-check.
    29	- **Surfaces hidden structure.** Proving an edge formally often reveals
    30	  ingredients that informal arguments hand-wave over.
