    11	
    12	> For `chiP : [1, W^d] → {0,1}` the prime indicator and `M^(j)` the
    13	> `(W^j × W^(d-j))` unfolding via base-`W` reshape, for every `W ≥ 2`
    14	> and every cut `1 ≤ j < d`:
    15	>
    16	>     rank M^(j)  =  min ( W^j ,  φ(W) · W^(d-j-1) + 1 ).
